# ENCAIXE alone with every fix: a piece slides under an overhang after it has
# touched down (the lock delay, docs/encaixe/GAME.md). The T-shaped first piece
# (kind 0) lands in columns 3-5 with its arms up; the O goes to the right; the
# third piece (an L, turned twice and moved to column 1) rests on the floor at
# 12700 ms, and the right key at 12800 ms slides it under the T's left arm.
# Dump with `--dump DIR --dump-every 50` to see it (frames 12000-13600).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame encaixe --headless --ms 14000 --fix all --input tools/play/encaixe-corrigida-slide.input
4100 key right
4250 key right
4400 key right
4550 key right
4700 key right
8700 key up
9000 key up
9300 key left
9450 key left
12800 key right
